[Mission.Objectives]
Cover the retreat of the 1075th Regiment, 316th Rifle Division by taking up defensive positions near the railway halt Dubosekovo.
[Mission.Description]
November 16. The 4th Company of the 1075th Regiment, 316th Rifle Division is taking up defensive positions on a hill near the railway stop at Dubosekovo, 7 kilometers southeast of Volokolamsk. Its main mission is to stop any attack by German troops (the 11th Panzer Division) and give the regiment a chance to retreat in order to better align the front lines. Heavy fighting in October has deprived the division of almost 50% of its manpower and nearly all its equipment. To help fulfill their mission, the company commanded by Captain Gundilovich and Politruk Klochkov received two 45mm antitank guns.     

Your order is to:
- Cover the retreat of the 1075th Regiment, 316th Rifle Division by taking up defensive positions near the railway stop at Dubosekovo.
[Mission.Success]
The order has been carried out!
[Mission.Failed]
You have failed to fulfill your order!
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Repel the enemy’s first echelon attack.
[Submission_1.Description]
Scouts report that the Germans intend to attack from the south-west along the highway leading to the railway stop at Dubosekovo. Their forward forces are limited: just an incomplete infantry platoon, two tanks and some armored vehicles.  

Your order is to:
- Repel the enemy attack. 
[Submission_1.Success]
Order fulfilled! The enemy attack has been repelled. 
[Submission_1.Failed]
You failed to fulfill your order! Your troops were destroyed. 
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Repel the enemy tank attack.
[Submission_2.Description]
Initial German forces failed to take the railway stop under their control and had to retreat. Now we should expect a more powerful wave attack with more panzers and infantry involved. The enemy must not break through into our rear area.

Your order is to:
- Stop the enemy panzers. 
[Submission_2.Success]
The order has been fulfilled! The enemy tank attack was repelled.
[Submission_2.Failed]
You have failed to fulfill your order! Your troops were defeated.
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Hold your positions.
[Submission_3.Description]
Not a single step back! Although Russia is large, there is nowhere to retreat anymore as Moscow lies behind.

Your order is to:
- Hold your positions.
[Submission_3.Success]
Your order has been fulfilled!
[Submission_3.Failed]
You have failed to fulfill your order!